## Requirements

- Python {{ python_version }}+
- [uv](https://github.com/astral-sh/uv) for dependency management
- [just](https://github.com/casey/just) for running tasks (optional but recommended)

## Installation

### Using uv (recommended)

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/{{ package_name }}.git
cd {{ package_name }}

# Install dependencies
uv sync

# Run the CLI
uv run {{ cli_name }} --help
```

### Using uvx (one-off)

```bash
# Run directly from git
uvx --from git+https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/{{ package_name }} {{ cli_name }} --help
```

